[
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0ea0416c68b995f4a4aa63f527f08a_20741.mp3",
    "author": "刘禹锡",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71284",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "杨柳青青江水平，闻郎江上唱歌声。(唱歌一作：踏歌)\n东边日出西边雨，道是无晴却有晴。(却有晴一作：还有晴)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20741,
    "name": "竹枝词二首·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a057fa628c295fdf1a570080ba27290_17658.mp3",
    "author": "李商隐",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "28591",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "向晚意不适，驱车登古原。\n夕阳无限好，只是近黄昏。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 17658,
    "name": "登乐游原"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c3b3d668e8a5547f740c053938_31296.mp3",
    "author": "杜牧",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "27845",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a075272f706fe564221d3ba7aaefe47_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "银烛秋光冷画屏，轻罗小扇扑流萤。\n天阶夜色凉如水，卧看牵牛织女星。(天阶一作：天街；卧看一作：坐看)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 31296,
    "name": "秋夕"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a34ba9d5a1d38a71b0878522d1492_25728.mp3",
    "author": "刘长卿",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "6588",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "日暮苍山远，天寒白屋贫。\n柴门闻犬吠，风雪夜归人。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 25728,
    "name": "逢雪宿芙蓉山主人"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a158bc5fabe63ecce27307e969438fd_22047.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "1013703",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "白发三千丈，缘愁似个长。\n不知明镜里，何处得秋霜。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22047,
    "name": "秋浦歌十七首·十五"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09a7f5c48b8a6a44b48c83f076bc8f_34142.mp3",
    "author": "黄庭坚",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "49913",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "春归何处？寂寞无行路。若有人知春去处，唤取归来同住。\n春无踪迹谁知？除非问取黄鹂。百啭无人能解，因风飞过蔷薇。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 34142,
    "name": "清平乐·春归何处"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a1080720ced48c8ac485019a7a60b95_31085.mp3",
    "author": "王观",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "65231",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "水是眼波横，山是眉峰聚。欲问行人去那边？眉眼盈盈处。才始送春归，又送君归去。若到江南赶上春，千万和春住。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 31085,
    "name": "卜算子·送鲍浩然之浙东"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0bea6a2832719622120725170fd288_20819.mp3",
    "author": "王安石",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "69089",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "京口瓜洲一水间，钟山只隔数重山。\n春风又绿江南岸，明月何时照我还。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20819,
    "name": "泊船瓜洲"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0beeb1dc3b3401f1dd5be481456742_17214.mp3",
    "author": "范仲淹",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "72390",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c4b5a2f98de17a03afa66cfb2b3_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "江上往来人，但爱鲈鱼美。\n君看一叶舟，出没风波里。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 17214,
    "name": "江上渔者"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03f30d027dd88dc23002bc19860366_26520.mp3",
    "author": "郑燮",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "清代",
    "id": "69361",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07fe0325c79e0120a0f4313da2b73b_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "咬定青山不放松，立根原在破岩中。\n千磨万击还坚劲，任尔东西南北风。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 26520,
    "name": "竹石"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03f283c4766f0fae3bbcb6f4733374_27768.mp3",
    "author": "王建",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "16151",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07fe0210474e9edc107e3868f9bf52_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "中庭地白树栖鸦，冷露无声湿桂花。\n今夜月明人尽望，不知秋思落谁家。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 27768,
    "name": "十五夜望月寄杜郎中"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0459d1782853dde465a5113ce8f2bf_43464.mp3",
    "author": "佚名",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "两汉",
    "id": "47873",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d584d3dd0d2c4403a165a7a2b784_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "迢迢牵牛星，皎皎河汉女。\n纤纤擢素手，札札弄机杼。\n终日不成章，泣涕零如雨。\n河汉清且浅，相去复几许。\n盈盈一水间，脉脉不得语。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 43464,
    "name": "迢迢牵牛星"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0f68fdcc81cfcd1e255f492ef23d2b_20636.mp3",
    "author": "韩翃",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "12445",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d57dc992b107040f4530722a11e9_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "春城无处不飞花，寒食东风御柳斜。\n日暮汉宫传蜡烛，轻烟散入五侯家。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20636,
    "name": "寒食"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0ee49c823b56bf88d5948fa5bbfc3e_43232.mp3",
    "author": "王安石",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "69085",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "茅檐长扫净无苔，花木成畦手自栽。\n一水护田将绿绕，两山排闼送青来。(一水一作：一手)\n桑条索漠楝花繁，风敛余香暗度垣。\n黄鸟数声残午梦，尚疑身属半山园。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 43232,
    "name": "书湖阴先生壁二首"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03f283019c01c5d46a70c57639b819_22680.mp3",
    "author": "杜牧",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "27620",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07fe016e240862e60974a8753919ae_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "千里莺啼绿映红，水村山郭酒旗风。\n南朝四百八十寺，多少楼台烟雨中。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22680,
    "name": "江南春"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0459ceefab3a170a1e4182027ff465_24912.mp3",
    "author": "刘禹锡",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71253",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d578795afeaa41394145165a42d4_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "九曲黄河万里沙，浪淘风簸自天涯。\n如今直上银河去，同到牵牛织女家。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24912,
    "name": "浪淘沙·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09a2ba685450c9606bd4f7d1a5dc35_24764.mp3",
    "author": "贺知章",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70849",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "少小离家老大回，乡音无改鬓毛衰。\n儿童相见不相识，笑问客从何处来。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24764,
    "name": "回乡偶书二首·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03f281125568705db32006ede18956_23832.mp3",
    "author": "朱熹",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "70974",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07fe011c0d3724e22ccb31ff20a9c6_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "胜日寻芳泗水滨，无边光景一时新。\n等闲识得东风面，万紫千红总是春。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23832,
    "name": "春日"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0e734483e0097765f530ba94868b98_30432.mp3",
    "author": "孟浩然",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7411",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0459c9ee4d8b08c0892c5debcba469_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "故人具鸡黍，邀我至田家。\n绿树村边合，青山郭外斜。\n开轩面场圃，把酒话桑麻。\n待到重阳日，还来就菊花。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 30432,
    "name": "过故人庄"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0b0cf9ecbc2ab212eb6a869f8aac73_86063.mp3",
    "author": "苏轼",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "1013639",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d52c8e6a23c41ec342c2618ff71e_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "黑云翻墨未遮山，白雨跳珠乱入船。\n卷地风来忽吹散，望湖楼下水如天。\n放生鱼鳖逐人来，无主荷花到处开。\n水枕能令山俯仰，风船解与月裴回。\n乌菱白芡不论钱，乱系青菰裹绿盘。\n忽忆尝新会灵观，滞留江海得加餐。\n献花游女木兰桡，细雨斜风湿翠翘。\n无限芳洲生杜若，吴儿不识楚辞招。\n未成小隐聊中隐，可得长闲胜暂闲。\n我本无家更安往，故乡无此好湖山。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 86063,
    "name": "六月二十七日望湖楼醉书"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04598e31b8cdc8412617fa21588ae0_28032.mp3",
    "author": "孟浩然",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7501",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d57ec6887cf338c4ff4e5a8aef6a_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "移舟泊烟渚，日暮客愁新。\n野旷天低树，江清月近人。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 28032,
    "name": "宿建德江"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03f27f286fe46145169ecf0db1c46c_22104.mp3",
    "author": "翁卷",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "70979",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07fe00e1b37fafa08b319d98741d0f_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "绿遍山原白满川，子规声里雨如烟。\n乡村四月闲人少，才了蚕桑又插田。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22104,
    "name": "乡村四月"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a5c5ed8b290f5cdb147e9a07a9f62_28848.mp3",
    "author": "陆游",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "73583",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "三万里河东入海，五千仞岳上摩天。\n遗民泪尽胡尘里，南望王师又一年。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 28848,
    "name": "秋夜将晓出篱门迎凉有感"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03f2706cf47c3cafea5ada872a0ff8_26784.mp3",
    "author": "王之涣",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70868",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf96aae00953d2eb2d6ca5ff0db8_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "黄河远上白云间，一片孤城万仞山。\n羌笛何须怨杨柳，春风不度玉门关。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 26784,
    "name": "凉州词二首·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037af318fb97acaa3dd4b9689cea53_23328.mp3",
    "author": "王昌龄",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71207",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867f2d70960f4f7f8cb55ee1cb2c_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "青海长云暗雪山，孤城遥望玉门关。\n黄沙百战穿金甲，不破楼兰终不还。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23328,
    "name": "从军行七首·其四"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03ed402fce5d99a4230aee54509c0b_21216.mp3",
    "author": "孟郊",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "19328",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf97189a44aa5769220f9f8bd89a_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "慈母手中线，游子身上衣。\n临行密密缝，意恐迟迟归。\n谁言寸草心，报得三春晖。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 21216,
    "name": "游子吟"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0575570a8d806f28866fb8d3bcfffd_17475.mp3",
    "author": "雷震",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "71216",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "草满池塘水满陂，山衔落日浸寒漪。\n牧童归去横牛背，短笛无腔信口吹。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 17475,
    "name": "村晚"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03ed3eedd93c234c5157155cd32a30_20232.mp3",
    "author": "杨万里",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "71297",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf96568f087f7aa22a2a52a9b8bd_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "稚子金盆脱晓冰，彩丝穿取当银钲。(银钲一作：银铮)\n敲成玉磬穿林响，忽作玻璃碎地声。(玻璃一作：玻瓈)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20232,
    "name": "稚子弄冰"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a06576c243420f8f67f7d0da8b7c022_20924.mp3",
    "author": "范成大",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "69140",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "昼出耘田夜绩麻，村庄儿女各当家。\n童孙未解供耕织，也傍桑阴学种瓜。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20924,
    "name": "四时田园杂兴·其三十一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a398319f3dc2216b95710d73b8f49_21000.mp3",
    "author": "朱熹",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "72144",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "昨夜江边春水生，蒙冲巨舰一毛轻。(蒙冲一作：艨艟)\n向来枉费推移力，此日中流自在行。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 21000,
    "name": "观书有感·其二"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a398479e2acc8997fb9f477c882db_24047.mp3",
    "author": "朱熹",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "69142",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "半亩方塘一鉴开，天光云影共徘徊。\n问渠那得清如许？为有源头活水来。(那通：哪)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24047,
    "name": "观书有感·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03ed3e178dd9e4c90ba9393c0ccab4_24143.mp3",
    "author": "张志和",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71049",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf9605e8987b854b5de4f55450ae_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "西塞山前白鹭飞，桃花流水鳜鱼肥。\n青箬笠，绿蓑衣，斜风细雨不须归。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24143,
    "name": "渔歌子·西塞山前白鹭飞"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a5c5702a2921397f44aaba77da378_34607.mp3",
    "author": "纳兰性德",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "清代",
    "id": "70751",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "山一程，水一程，身向榆关那畔行，夜深千帐灯。\n风一更，雪一更，聒碎乡心梦不成，故园无此声。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 34607,
    "name": "长相思·山一程"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037af1171551c44e4dcad25fc6d625_23880.mp3",
    "author": "张继",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "12271",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867ea0b485bce2e3a9daa1339786_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "月落乌啼霜满天，江枫渔火对愁眠。\n姑苏城外寒山寺，夜半钟声到客船。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23880,
    "name": "枫桥夜泊"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037aec5d94c8db1db37bb23e676fcb_20784.mp3",
    "author": "林升",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "70973",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867d4cfc2805740eba3b1885f3bb_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "山外青山楼外楼，西湖歌舞几时休？\n暖风熏得游人醉，直把杭州作汴州。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20784,
    "name": "题临安邸"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03ed3d8b54a52aa6fbc086c9e48d11_21696.mp3",
    "author": "陆游",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "69134",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf956fd51e2664a82832468fb0e1_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "死去元知万事空，但悲不见九州同。\n王师北定中原日，家祭无忘告乃翁。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 21696,
    "name": "示儿"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03ed3d05cd4e1d02a5ce7d76db5946_22440.mp3",
    "author": "林杰",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "24482",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf952aeb18790682faac5adf8225_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "七夕今宵看碧霄，牵牛织女渡河桥。\n家家乞巧望秋月，穿尽红丝几万条。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22440,
    "name": "乞巧"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04597efe54b1c07ee6bf44a9dd473c_24504.mp3",
    "author": "虞世南",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "2347",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d57accd3d98829d5be197d53ce2b_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "垂緌饮清露，流响出疏桐。\n居高声自远，非是藉秋风。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24504,
    "name": "蝉"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cecb67a794334af383f838b27ca8_21720.mp3",
    "author": "王冕",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "元代",
    "id": "69175",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf946a2e601dc81de0442e48cdab_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "我家洗砚池头树，朵朵花开淡墨痕。(我家一作：吾家；朵朵一作：个个)\n不要人夸好颜色，只留清气满乾坤。(好颜色一作：颜色好)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 21720,
    "name": "墨梅"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04597dca6757b08d2de37c3cf853f8_19536.mp3",
    "author": "卢纶",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70883",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a04597de04c994dbcd9cd0b0a1de42f_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "月黑雁飞高，单于夜遁逃。\n欲将轻骑逐，大雪满弓刀。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19536,
    "name": "塞下曲"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03ceca8762ad446d446ea1b248e8ef_21024.mp3",
    "author": "王昌龄",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70843",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf93f7ba39a92cd597c5b517e0fa_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "寒雨连江夜入吴，平明送客楚山孤。\n洛阳亲友如相问，一片冰心在玉壶。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 21024,
    "name": "芙蓉楼送辛渐"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04597cf8752b45b8840b5f62bb0162_16128.mp3",
    "author": "罗隐",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "35987",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a79ed09ba6715af25199925d84_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "不论平地与山尖，无限风光尽被占。\n采得百花成蜜后，为谁辛苦为谁甜？",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 16128,
    "name": "蜂"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a16a801e9c8ec59d939371f3ff60ab9_24111.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71213",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "黄师塔前江水东，春光懒困倚微风。\n桃花一簇开无主，可爱深红爱浅红？",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24111,
    "name": "江畔独步寻花·其五"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04597a3ed14fe8b69341f528791e37_31296.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57611",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a74c1b60a3c61b8bd9f4643ce2_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "茅檐低小，溪上青青草。醉里吴音相媚好，白发谁家翁媪？\n大儿锄豆溪东，中儿正织鸡笼。最喜小儿亡赖，溪头卧剥莲蓬。(亡同：无)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 31296,
    "name": "清平乐·村居"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a049757dd43514295944097883d8cc6_20741.mp3",
    "author": "范成大",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "71215",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d582608ab2ef033ac11d86483fd2_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "梅子金黄杏子肥，麦花雪白菜花稀。\n日长篱落无人过，惟有蜻蜓蛱蝶飞。(惟通：唯)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20741,
    "name": "四时田园杂兴·其二十五"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04596f0d79e098134993a83377e8c4_22512.mp3",
    "author": "杨万里",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "70972",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a70d29059319016898f435c398_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "篱落疏疏一径深，树头新绿未成阴。(新绿一作：花落)\n儿童急走追黄蝶，飞入菜花无处寻。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22512,
    "name": "宿新市徐公店"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a15d3e138faecca19434c9de2e53d10_22728.mp3",
    "author": "王翰",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70844",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867ce775d95e353b6edc0a4309d8_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "葡萄美酒夜光杯，欲饮琵琶马上催。\n醉卧沙场君莫笑，古来征战几人回？",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22728,
    "name": "凉州词"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0459679ae18da9a7d46c01a24d5ec3_26736.mp3",
    "author": "王昌龄",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70869",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a6269e856e284b1597fa83a10e_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "秦时明月汉时关，万里长征人未还。\n但使龙城飞将在，不教胡马度阴山。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 26736,
    "name": "出塞"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04975430110d0816af5b4d91eb0d3a_19175.mp3",
    "author": "李商隐",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "29084",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d587c245db37be21c085c7b73d05_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "云母屏风烛影深，长河渐落晓星沉。\n嫦娥应悔偷灵药，碧海青天夜夜心。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19175,
    "name": "嫦娥"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0f5a981372653b134d7b630d1f0823_28839.mp3",
    "author": "卢钺",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "71244",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "有梅无雪不精神，有雪无诗俗了人。\n日暮诗成天又雪，与梅并作十分春。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 28839,
    "name": "雪梅·其二"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04594b917b669818bb2f7eed5b67ef_23808.mp3",
    "author": "卢钺",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "70989",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a04594b9a3bc9912348580eba54903e_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "梅雪争春未肯降，骚人阁笔费评章。\n梅须逊雪三分白，雪却输梅一段香。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23808,
    "name": "雪梅·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04594b11f150214539966d01b864e3_20472.mp3",
    "author": "苏轼",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "69101",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a50fbf8ef411d3e2d4bfbcf9c1_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "横看成岭侧成峰，远近高低各不同。\n不识庐山真面目，只缘身在此山中。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20472,
    "name": "题西林壁"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae722b678558d2241312c4c8dda_19296.mp3",
    "author": "白居易",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "22492",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867c9b8388ae391e390aeaf0d8f6_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "一道残阳铺水中，半江瑟瑟半江红。\n可怜九月初三夜，露似真珠月似弓。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19296,
    "name": "暮江吟"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0459495070407d43a00bfdb99a8c38_24408.mp3",
    "author": "刘禹锡",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "74628",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a4bba59157d94ca94276c9f084_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "八月涛声吼地来，头高数丈触山回。\n须臾却入海门去，卷起沙堆似雪堆。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24408,
    "name": "浪淘沙·其七"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a14f22859d8ff74071b6ddd2fd86db1_16248.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71212",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "迟日江山丽，春风花草香。\n泥融飞燕子，沙暖睡鸳鸯。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 16248,
    "name": "绝句"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae2efc1cafc86a060be25ae27ee_28536.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "11131",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867af9e6f3457ef3d32c4aa10761_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "迟日江山丽，春风花草香。\n\n泥融飞燕子，沙暖睡鸳鸯。\n\n江碧鸟逾白，山青花欲燃。\n\n今春看又过，何日是归年。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 28536,
    "name": "绝句二首"
  }
]
